OverTheWire Bandit: Level 18 → 19

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 19.
Logging in normally logs you out immediately, so the password must be read without an interactive shell.

Steps
Execute a command directly over SSH:
ssh bandit18@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220 cat readme

Result
The output of the command displays the password for Bandit Level 19.

